<section class="mainContent"> 
  <div class="navBreadcrumbs"><a href="/planning-zoning" class="CMSBreadCrumbsLink">Planning &amp; Zoning</a> &gt; <span  class="CMSBreadCrumbsCurrentItem">Boston Zoning Code</span>
</div>


<header class="interiorHeader">
    <aside class="interiorHeaderImg">
        <h1>
            <span id="p_lt_ctl02_wPagePlaceholder_p_lt_ctl02_pageplaceholder_p_lt_ctl00_rptSectionHeading_repItems_ctl00_ctl00_TeaserImage_lblTitle">Boston Zoning Code</span>
        </h1>
        
    </aside>
    
    
</header>


<p>
	The Boston Zoning Code&rsquo;s goals are to promote the health, safety, convenience, and welfare of the inhabitants of the City; to encourage the most appropriate use of land throughout the City; to prevent overcrowding of land; to conserve the value of land and buildings; to lessen congestion in the streets; to avoid undue concentration of population; to provide adequate light and air; to secure safety from fire, panic and other dangers; to facilitate adequate provision for transportation, water, sewerage, schools, parks and other public requirements; and to preserve and increase the amenities of the City.</p>
<h2>
	Boston Zoning Code</h2>
<p>
	Access the whole document on <a href="https://library.municode.com/ma/boston/codes/redevelopment_authority" target="_blank">Municode</a>.</p>
<p class="submitBtn">
	<a href="https://library.municode.com/ma/boston/codes/redevelopment_authority" target="_blank"><input style="font-size: 18px;" type="button" value="Boston Zoning Code" /></a></p>
<h2>
	Boston Zoning Maps</h2>
<p>
	Explore <a href="https://www.bostonplans.org/3d-data-maps/gis-maps/zoning-maps">maps</a> illustrating Boston&#39;s Zoning regulations.</p>
<p class="submitBtn">
	<a href="https://www.bostonplans.org/3d-data-maps/gis-maps/zoning-maps"><input style="font-size: 18px;" type="button" value="Boston Zoning Maps" /></a></p>
<h2>
	Boston Zoning Viewer</h2>
<p>
	View planning and zoning information for properties across the City of Boston on the <a href="http://maps.bostonplans.org/zoningviewer/" target="_blank">Zoning Viewer</a>. This interactive web-mapping application was designed to assist City staff and the public in locating and determining zoning information for Boston land parcels.</p>
<p class="submitBtn">
	<a href="http://maps.bostonplans.org/zoningviewer/" target="_blank"><input style="font-size: 18px;" type="button" value="Boston Zoning Viewer" /></a></p>


     
</section>

</div>
</section>
